                                "sense_id": "414bd680-507d-36e5-968f-aadc4fa7b66e",
                                "text": "He said he would not ransom Mortimer; / Forbade my tongue to speak of Mortimer; / But I will find him when he lies asleep, / And in his ear I'll holla ‘Mortimer!’"
                            }
                        ]
